// THE IMBUED ANCIENT CAPE and the ancient fabric that makes it.
//
// WHAT IT IS: Old School's own item, released 7 October 2026 - a cosmetic variant of an imbued god
// cape, made by using an ancient fabric on one. There the fabric is a reward from Pete Kayer's last
// challenge; here the Undertaker sells it for Death tokens, alongside the nine whip colours, which
// is this server's shelf for exactly this kind of thing.
//
// THE MODELS ARE JAGEX'S, and getting them took a newer cache. The cape was released four weeks
// after caches/newest cache was taken, so it is not in that item table at all; OpenRS2 cache 2746
// (20 October 2026) has it, and the four models come from there - 62044 the cape, 62047/62049 the
// worn pair, 62045 the fabric. The black body, the purple hem and Zaros's mark are all in the mesh
// as plain coloured faces, with no texture anywhere, so the 377 client draws it as Old School does.
//
// THREE RECORDS AND NOT ONE, which is the one place this parts company with Old School. There the
// three recipes all give the same single item, because its cape is Zarosian and Old School does not
// gate anything on which god cape you are wearing. Here they do: a god spell needs that god's cape
// AND that god's staff (area_mage_arena/scripts/god_gear.rs2, through configs/god_cape.enum), and
// the Saradomin and Zamorak capes carry a God Wars protection param. One shared record would have
// to drop both - quietly taking a spell and a protection off a player who bought a cosmetic - so
// the fabric makes the ancient version OF THE CAPE IT WAS USED ON: same god, same params, same
// everything but the look. All three are called "Imbued ancient cape" and are indistinguishable in
// the bank; the examine text says which cape each one was, which is the only way to tell them
// apart and the only time it matters.
//
// THE SHELF SELLS STATUS, NOT POWER (death_token_shop.inv). These three change no number at all -
// they are field-for-field copies of the imbued capes in mage_arena_2.obj - and the fabric is
// untradeable, so the look cannot become a market.
//
// NOT CARRIED ACROSS: Old School's cape is a Zarosian item and gives God Wars protection against
// Zarosian npcs. There are none here - this build's God Wars Dungeon has four wings and no Ancient
// Prison - so a gwd_prot_zaros param would be a param nothing reads. The +2% magic damage is left
// out for the same kind of reason: this build has no magic damage percentage anywhere, in gear or
// in the spell code, because 2006 had none.

[ancient_fabric]
name=Ancient fabric
desc=Use it on an imbued god cape. Revert takes it back off.
model=obj_ancient_fabric
2dzoom=1360
2dxan=456
2dyan=183
2dxof=1
2dyof=4
weight=453g
// Old School values it at 1 coin. The Undertaker's shelf prices in Death tokens through its own
// multiplier, and 500 is what every kit on that shelf carries, so it carries it too.
cost=500
members=yes
tradeable=no
category=ancient_fabric

// ---------------------------------------------------------------- Saradomin
[imbued_ancient_cape_saradomin]
name=Imbued ancient cape
desc=A Saradomin cape, remade in ancient fabric. Revert gives the Saradomin cape back.
model=obj_imbued_ancient_cape
manwear=obj_imbued_ancient_cape_manwear,0
womanwear=obj_imbued_ancient_cape_womanwear,0
wearpos=back
2dzoom=1756
2dxan=364
2dyan=483
2dxof=0
2dyof=3
weight=453g
cost=80000
members=yes
tradeable=no
iop2=Wear
iop5=Revert
category=armour_godcape
param=magicattack,15
param=stabdefence,3
param=slashdefence,3
param=crushdefence,3
param=magicdefence,15
param=gwd_prot_saradomin,1
param=ancient_cape_from,imbued_saradomin_cape

